---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About GlobalsBlog"
	description="Learn what GlobalsBlog publishes, the categories it covers, and how the site is structured for better reading and discovery."
>
	<section class="content-page">
		<div class="content-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">About the publication</p>
			<h1>GlobalsBlog covers practical stories across travel, beauty, auto, and news.</h1>
			<p class="lede">
				The site is designed as a readable editorial platform where visitors can quickly discover
				fresh articles, browse category archives, and find clear information about the business
				behind the publication.
			</p>
		</div>

		<div class="content-grid">
			<article class="content-card">
				<h2>What we publish</h2>
				<p>
					GlobalsBlog features destination ideas, beauty tips, auto updates, and general news-led
					stories for readers who want useful, easy-to-read content in one place.
				</p>
				<ul class="content-list">
					<li>Travel guides, ideas, and destination-focused articles</li>
					<li>Beauty tips, routines, and product-led explainers</li>
					<li>Auto stories covering cars, trends, and ownership topics</li>
					<li>News and timely updates relevant to a broad online audience</li>
				</ul>
			</article>

			<aside class="content-card content-card-accent">
				<h2>Why this site exists</h2>
				<p>
					The goal is straightforward: combine category clarity, strong readability, and
					trust-building pages such as contact, privacy, and terms so readers and partners can
					navigate the site with confidence.
				</p>
			</aside>
		</div>
	</section>
</Layout>
